*  RSTORY_driver - drives RSTORY.SNO, which generates a random story from the
*  BNF-style grammar in its own data file.  Contract per RSTORY.sno header:
*  "Use RSTORY.IN as sample input file: SNOBOL4 RSTORY <RSTORY.IN".
*  RSTORY carries its own END, so a driver can only be the include; the fixture
*  RSTORY_driver.in is the shipped RSTORY.IN.
-INCLUDE "RSTORY.sno"
